{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Remember where living things are hiding, then press the keys to the rhythm in this fun and fluffy music game!</strong> \ud83c\udfb6</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd30 How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple! Just memorize the example pattern and press any key you like \ud83d\udc46\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440840/extras/9a4ca42ba12748e35bdbcfafb11ac9de.poster.avif?t=1774068896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440840/extras/9a4ca42ba12748e35bdbcfafb11ac9de.webm?t=1774068896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440840/extras/9a4ca42ba12748e35bdbcfafb11ac9de.mp4?t=1774068896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Living things remember which key you pressed! <br>\ud83d\udd39 &quot;Press the same key for the same Living things&quot;\u2014don\u2019t forget! \ud83d\udd0d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440840/extras/04a4181d54c2cc03fb7e5c6ffe846d43.poster.avif?t=1774068896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440840/extras/04a4181d54c2cc03fb7e5c6ffe846d43.webm?t=1774068896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440840/extras/04a4181d54c2cc03fb7e5c6ffe846d43.mp4?t=1774068896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragra